// Conformance fixture for ta.change (S-bead OpenBBTechnical-0e9.5.35, Wave 5B-4).
//
// Author-derivative posture per PRD §7.3: reference output computed by
// hand-executing the bar-over-bar difference against a hard-coded
// synthetic close series (see ta_change.csv `close` column).
//
// Default ``length = 1`` — the first bar has NA (no previous bar to
// diff against). Subsequent bars produce close[i] - close[i-1].
//@version=6
indicator("smoke_ta_change", overlay=false)
plot(ta.change(close), title="chg1")
